  character_Bio: "New city, new people, new gigs, a fresh new start to your life.
    You\u2019re not from around here, only arriving recently in the city, and still
    adjusting to its many quirks and niches. Pretty soon, you find yourself running
    low on cash, the price of living in the city\u2019s ecosystem a little higher
    than you expected. After a couple of dead ends, you finally find a gig offering
    a big enough score to sate your needs, and after a few preparations, head out
    to make a name for yourself."
